# End-of-day net settlement between three participants, in cents.
# This step is gated: it runs only when every payment above is TRUE.
TREATY EOD-NET USD SETL
PARTY BANKA 5000000 0 1/3
PARTY BANKB 5000000 0 1/3
PARTY BANKC 5000000 0 1/3
OWE BANKA BANKB 1250000
OWE BANKB BANKC 900000
OWE BANKC BANKA 400000
END
